# Lightweight installable package archive boundary (`git archive` <= 5 MiB):
# keep all package/extension sources, runnable examples + input data, manual
# markdown sources + README hero figure, scripts, and ordinary `Pkg.test()`
# fixtures; exclude repository CI metadata, local manifests, rendered manual
# gallery figures, computed narrative report archives, and opt-in
# `BAYESIANMGMFRM_RESEARCH_EVIDENCE_TESTS=true` study JSON archives.
# Keep `.github/workflows/CI.yml` (2.9 KiB gz) so `test/test_group_selection.jl`
# can verify the CI shard matrix inside extracted package archives.
.gitattributes export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
Manifest*.toml export-ignore

